  "concept": {
    "zh": "先算出来，才能显示",
    "en": "Calculate the result before displaying it"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "给芽芽补 3 格电。用图卡安排程序每一步要做的事，再看看调换顺序会发生什么。",
    "en": "Give Sprout 3 more units of charge. Arrange the cards to tell the program what to do, then see what happens when two steps switch places."
  },
